{"maj":[{"id":"majj","headword":"मज्ज्","headword_slp1":"majj","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्ज् (probably मद्-जन्; cf. मद्गु and Lat. mergere; the Indian grammarians write मस्ज्), i. 6, Par. (in epic poetry also Ātm., "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 2, 605","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":"). The base of many forms is मञ्ज्.\n 1. To dive, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bhartṛ. 2, 91.\n 2","q":"Bhartṛ"},{"t":"txt","s":". To bathe, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 5299.\n 3","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To sink, Vikr. d. 133; to perish in water, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 1, 1, 89.\n 4","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". To sink into, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 3717","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":" (loc.); "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 4, 81","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":" (acc.).\n 5. To be plunged, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 10, 91.\n 6","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". To become disheartened, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 5631","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --Ptcple. of the pf. pass. मग्न,\n 1. Plunged, Hit. i. d. 4, M.M.; dived, immersed, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 3, 52, 19.\n 2","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":". Sunk, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 197, 6","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":"; drowned, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 17, 27","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --"},{"t":"cite","s":"Caus.\n 1","q":"Caus.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". To cause to plunge, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 3908.\n 2","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To overwhelm, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rām. 2, 77, 13","q":"Rām"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With the prep. उद् उद्,\n 1. To emerge, Śāk. d. 167.\n 2. Pass. impers. To rise, Śiś. 9, 30.\n --Caus. To force up, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 8, 115","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With नि नि,\n 1. To bathe, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 5, 73.\n 2","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". To submerge, to sink under, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 4, 194","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":"; Hit. ii. d. 145.\n 3. To disappear, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 2, 1504.\n 4","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". To cause to sink (into hell), "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 1, 4156","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":". निमग्न,\n 1. Plunged in, immersed, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rājat. 5, 85.\n 2","q":"Rājat"},{"t":"txt","s":". Sunk in (not prominent), Vikr. d. 80; "},{"t":"cite","s":"Rājat. 5, 74","q":"Rājat"},{"t":"txt","s":"; slender, d. 129.\n 3. Covered, Daśak. in "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 199, 6","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --"},{"t":"cite","s":"Caus.\n 1","q":"Caus.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". To cause to dive under water, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Man. 8, 114.\n 2","q":"Man"},{"t":"txt","s":". To cause to be submerged, "},{"t":"cite","s":"MBh. 3, 16612","q":"MBh"},{"t":"txt","s":".\n --With प्र प्र, प्र-मग्न, Immersed, drowned."}]}]}],"majakft":[{"id":"majjakft","headword":"मज्जकृत्","headword_slp1":"majjakft","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्जकृत्, i. e. मज्जन्-कृ + त्, n. A bone."}]}]}],"majan":[{"id":"majjan","headword":"मज्जन्","headword_slp1":"majjan","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्जन् (perhaps for original [] मर्जन्; cf. O.H.G. marag; A.S. mearh, mearg, merg), m.\n 1. The marrow of the bones and flesh.\n 2. The pith or sap of trees."}]}]}],"maja":[{"id":"majjA","headword":"मज्जा","headword_slp1":"majjA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्जा (cf. the last), f. The marrow of the bones and flesh. Pañc. i. d. 191, cf. my translation, n. 171.\n --Comp."}]}]}],"majana":[{"id":"majjana","headword":"मज्जन","headword_slp1":"majjana","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्ज् + अन, n.\n 1. "},{"t":"cite","s":"Immersion.\n 2","q":""},{"t":"txt","s":". "},{"t":"cite","s":"Bathing.\n 3","q":"Bathing.\n"},{"t":"txt","s":". Drowning, Pañc. i. d. 34."}]}]}],"majusa":[{"id":"majjUzA","headword":"मज्जूषा","headword_slp1":"majjUzA","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्जूषा = मञ्जूषा."}]}]}],"majman":[{"id":"majman","headword":"मज्मन्","headword_slp1":"majman","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्मन्, n. Strength, "},{"t":"cite","s":"Chr. 290, 3","q":"Chr"},{"t":"txt","s":" = Rigv. i. 64, 3.\n --Cf. Lat. magmentum."}]}]}],"majasamudBava":[{"id":"majjasamudBava","headword":"मज्जसमुद्भव","headword_slp1":"majjasamudBava","senses_r":[{"n":1,"spans":[{"t":"txt","s":"मज्ज-समुद्भव, i. e. मज्जन्-, n. semen genitale."}]}]}]}